{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55417","headline":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 一 · 沈彬","name":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向隅书剑坐销魂，心计艰难有泪痕。\n三月不寻花下路，一春常闭雨中门。\n闲时易得开书帙，贫手难求傍酒樽。\n三十无成今四十，翊周安汉意空存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}